Station cases are original fiction. They contain no real patient data and no Royal College
of Psychiatrists (RCPsych) station scripts, question banks or eLearning content. Station
structure follows the published MRCPsych CASC blueprint (March 2023); RCPsych retains
copyright in its syllabus and blueprint, which are not reproduced here. CascAid is not
affiliated with or endorsed by RCPsych.

Third-party software, models, voices and avatar assets are not included in this
repository. They are downloaded at install time under their own licences, recorded in
config/model-register.json, config/avatar-register.json and docs/AVATAR-PLAN.md.
